{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a group of space settlers trying to <strong>establish a base</strong>\u00a0on a <strong>remote world</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your base</i>, <i>mine resources</i>, <i>grow food</i>, <i>research technologies</i>, <i>survive disasters</i>, and experience what near-future humans might be up against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetbase\u00a02</strong> features a unique blend of\u00a0<i>real-time strategy</i>, <i>city building</i> and <i>survival</i> gameplay. You <i>design and automate</i> your base at a <i>high level</i> as much as possible, but when required, you can <strong>control</strong> individual <i>people</i>, <i>robots</i>\u00a0or\u00a0<i>vehicles</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize the Solar System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize <strong>Mars</strong> and the worlds beyond. Each location posing its own <strong>unique</strong> and increasingly difficult <strong>challenge</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine and Manufacture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of in-situ resources in order to build a self sustaining colony. Harvest <strong>regolith</strong>, mine <strong>metals</strong>, establish <strong>manufacturing</strong> industries and do whatever it takes for your colony to <strong>survive</strong> and <strong>thrive</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/1ff4cd5fa11d4d356db3c82422120d34.poster.avif?t=1772829736\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/1ff4cd5fa11d4d356db3c82422120d34.webm?t=1772829736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/1ff4cd5fa11d4d356db3c82422120d34.mp4?t=1772829736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Produce Food</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate <i>vegetables</i> in giant greenhouses, synthesize <i>meat</i> in the lab, produce food in any way possible. <strong>Keep your people alive</strong>\u00a0and achieve self sufficiency. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the power of Nature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy from whatever sources are available in each world. Develop the systems required to harvest and store energy from <strong>The Sun</strong>, <strong>Wind</strong>, <strong>Nuclear</strong> and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Withstand Planetary Hazards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter planet specific natural disasters like\u00a0<i>Solar Flares</i>, <i>Sandstorms</i>, <i>Meteors</i>, <i>Dust Devils</i> and more.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire <strong>technologies</strong> that will alter gameplay in a meaningful way and make it possible for your base to\u00a0<strong>develop</strong> from a small <i>outpost</i> to a vibrant <i>colony</i>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct Vehicles and Robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manufacture or import <strong>vehicles</strong> and <strong>robots</strong> that will aid with the hardest tasks in the settlement and increase your chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/d4c868a315e1bcd74d84b3c594310ea3.avif?t=1772829736\" width=1560 height=382 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated systems will allow you to manage your colony <strong>without micromanagement</strong> most of the time. However, when the need arises, you will be able to give <strong>specific commands</strong> to individuals, so they do what you need them to. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509420?t=1772829736","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509420?t=1772829736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/444ee04178b15c57c2daaac607961f55bcd44e28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772829736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/444ee04178b15c57c2daaac607961f55bcd44e28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772829736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a group of space settlers trying to <strong>establish a base</strong>\u00a0on a <strong>remote world</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your base</i>, <i>mine resources</i>, <i>grow food</i>, <i>research technologies</i>, <i>survive disasters</i>, and experience what near-future humans might be up against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetbase\u00a02</strong> features a unique blend of\u00a0<i>real-time strategy</i>, <i>city building</i> and <i>survival</i> gameplay. You <i>design and automate</i> your base at a <i>high level</i> as much as possible, but when required, you can <strong>control</strong> individual <i>people</i>, <i>robots</i>\u00a0or\u00a0<i>vehicles</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize the Solar System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize <strong>Mars</strong> and the worlds beyond. Each location posing its own <strong>unique</strong> and increasingly difficult <strong>challenge</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine and Manufacture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of in-situ resources in order to build a self sustaining colony. Harvest <strong>regolith</strong>, mine <strong>metals</s