"bb_paragraph\" >Manufacture or import <strong>vehicles</strong> and <strong>robots</strong> that will aid with the hardest tasks in the settlement and increase your chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/d4c868a315e1bcd74d84b3c594310ea3.avif?t=1772829736\" width=1560 height=382 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated systems will allow you to manage your colony <strong>without micromanagement</strong> most of the time. However, when the need arises, you will be able to give <strong>specific commands</strong> to individuals, so they do what you need them to. </p>","developers":["Madruga Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/0e68ad281e107e20c8fae0537979f750eeae7eb3/header.jpg?t=1772829736","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509420/852561/4bb93c8a0853481b161ea31bd3611c6ed3719603/1750856914/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742218885","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509420/852561/4bb93c8a0853481b161ea31bd3611c6ed3719603/1750856914/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742218885","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509420/852561/4bb93c8a0853481b161ea31bd3611c6ed3719603/1750856914/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742218885","id":257115388,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat