s trying to establish a base on Mars and beyond. Grow food, mine resources, manufacture goods and face the challenges these unforgiving worlds will throw at you.","steam_appid":3509420,"support_info":{"email":"mwcontact@madrugaworks.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}